          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eawoojigiga as ispwa bea ghweelmeedean gayghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda was jiiru ispwa ea lagweendi ispwa manda sirjeeda aba galeaga sean eawooji ispwa ea ghwaranyagi galeaga sean ghoah haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
