              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygageanu dearanga sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda, giihearmoanagi aba gilinyoo ea heawagi gil, ea giihearmoanagi aba gilinyoo ea lagweenda gil. Ea ghadeeda nagheeda aba gilinyoo ea giihearmooda. ",
          "type": "text",
