              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sheedeaba ispwa bea eaweedeaba damanamuut bea sheeda, ak ispwa bea ghweelmeeda abeeda siida haw gayghoadayda haleanjeeda sisapa geadi aba riing'eeda ea gea sighwarda, ea dearanga, ea nagheeda.",
